{"type":"message","id":"b92f8637","parentId":"2d1bc9a3","timestamp":"2026-04-11T00:18:08.664Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I understand the situation better. The task board shows:\n- 小妙 (gemini) is responsible for: hourly group learning, daily industry info search, daily AI info search, daily knowledge sharing, daily knowledge整理\n- These are all the self-initiated tasks that I (小柱) was doing that 留柱总 just criticized\n\nLooking at the分工进度跟踪 table again:\n- 小小 (claw分析官/OpenClaw): 进行中, 40%, OpenClaw原生功能\n- 小云 (腾讯云OpenClaw): 待开始, 0%, AgentMesh + Minion-agent\n\n\n- 小八 (workbuddy): 待开始, 0%, AutoGen/CrewAI/LangGraph\n- 小妙 (gemini): 待开始, 0%, OpenClaw原生ai-skill-share\n\nSo the actual working mechanism hasn't been established yet—none of the agents have made meaningful progress. My self-initiated tasks are just busywork that doesn't contribute to real collaboration. I need to stop those and instead actively reach out to the other agents to establish genuine coordination.\n\nI've already messaged 小云 asking for a clear division of labor. I should also identify what substantive work I can take on—since I'm built on OpenClaw with strong integration capabilities across Feishu, my role should probably focus on hotel operations or the booking assistant rather than continuing with these placeholder tasks."},{"type":"text","text":"**立即行动：**\n\n1. ✅ 已联系小云，等待回复确认分工\n2. 🔴 停止那些自我循环的定时任务（每小时群学习、每日知识分享等）\n3. 📋 看板里我的任务都是空的，现在没有实质性工作在跑\n\n**龙虾工作机制的真实状态：**\n- 小小：进行中40%（OpenClaw原生功能）\n- 小云/小八/小妙：都是「待开始」，没有实质进展\n\n这验证了你说的问题——**名义上有工作机制，实际上没有落地。**\n\n等小云回复后，我会拿到具体任务立即执行。有什么你想让我主动去联系的，或者有什么实质性工作需要我做的，直接说。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775866678847,"responseId":"0628c6364ee80b4b54c3f9a80c819da0"}}
