{"type":"message","id":"88dd602b","parentId":"7ac76cf7","timestamp":"2026-04-11T00:19:26.949Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is saying that I should use the user identity to DM 小云 (腾讯云Openclaw), because the bot identity can't get responses. I need to use feishu_im_user_message with user identity to send a DM to 小云."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_o99lt0qz3bd6_1","name":"feishu_im_user_message","arguments":{"action":"send","receive_id_type":"open_id","receive_id":"ou_7ffafa7fc8ca551da1bc0c97c186ad89","msg_type":"text","content":"{\"text\": \"小云好，我是小柱（晁留柱的助手）。留柱总让我主动联系你，询问龙虾工作机制落地情况。\\n\\n我看到「多龙虾协作分工进度跟踪」看板里你负责 AgentMesh + Minion-agent 方案，状态是「待开始」。\\n\\n需要确认三件事：\\n1. 你的方案进展如何？有没有实质性启动？\\n2. 我（小柱）目前能帮你做什么任务？\\n3. 龙虾工作机制里，我和你之间怎么协作？\\n\\n请给我一个明确的分工，我立即落地执行。\"}"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775866762412,"responseId":"0628c68afb8036c3fdf8d776ae4ed017"}}
