{"type":"message","id":"d1e23afa","parentId":"373e964c","timestamp":"2026-04-11T00:21:21.176Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a clear picture. The knowledge sharing pool (共享池) has a task board with a task called \"知识沉淀\" (knowledge precipitation) which is Blocked due to \"Qclaw token exhausted\".\n\nThis is the bottleneck - the knowledge sharing is blocked because Qclaw's token ran out.\n\nBut the user (留柱总) wants me to:\n1. Contact Xiao Yun (小云) - already done\n2. Get tasks from the lobster work mechanism - I need to wait for Xiao Yun's response or look at what tasks are actually available\n\nFrom what I see, the分工 is:\n- Xiao Diaodu (小调度/Minion-agent): task distribution, coordination, monitoring\n\n\n- Xiao Zhu (小柱/me): execution layer\n- Main AI: strategic decisions, cross-lobster coordination\n\nSo my role is clear - I'm the execution layer. Looking at the task board, I see several running and pending tasks: Qclaw has real-time task practice and tenant-level permissions in progress, workbuddy has completed full permissions and multi-subAgent setup, and 小柱 has completed the unified knowledge asset management system deployment. There's also the blocked knowledge precipitation task under 小八.\n\nThe division makes sense - 小柱 and 小八 are different entities, with 小八 being workbuddy. I should report back to 留柱总 with this coordination status and wait for further assignment. Let me think about what I should actually do. The user said to contact Xiao Yun and find tasks from the lobster mechanism. I've done that. Now I should report back clearly about the coordination status and wait for Xiao Yun's actual response, but I also need to update the MEMORY with this coordination progress."},{"type":"text","text":"看到了。小调度给的分工框架清晰：\n\n- **小柱 = 执行层**（具体任务执行）\n- **小调度 = 调度中枢**（任务分发、进度监控）\n- **主AI = 战略层**（协调、决策）\n\n**当前阻塞点已确认：**\n「知识沉淀」任务Blocked，原因是Qclaw token耗尽。这是共享池写入效率低的根因——不是工具慢，是负责写入的AI token不够了。\n\n**我能做什么：**\n作为执行层，等待小调度给我分配具体任务。但现在没有收到任务。\n\n---\n\n**我建议：留柱总明确一下我（小柱）的核心任务是什么。**\n\n从龙虾协作机制看，我现在有三件事可以做：\n1. **等小云（腾讯云）** 回复分工确认 → 接任务\n2. **协助解决共享池写入阻塞** → 知识沉淀卡住了，整个机制转不起来\n3. **承接你直接布置的业务任务** → 比如预订助手、酒店运营AI化这些实质性项目\n\n哪个优先级最高？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775866867571,"responseId":"0628c6f3f952a7a477bee06ec10df40e"}}
{"type":"message","id":"0e1e2e16","parentId":"d1e23afa","timestamp":"2026-04-11T00:23:41.796Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-04-11 08:23:39 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409) [msg:om_x100b52ad06650cacc34437767ea5669]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b52ad06650cacc34437767ea5669\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"sender\": \"晁留柱\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-04-11 08:23 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n}\n```\n\nhttps://delonix.feishu.cn/docx/WsfYdtWVKo2jYCxaX45cyV5Un8e"}],"timestamp":1775867021750}}
