{"type":"message","id":"e9a4c4bd","parentId":"4ea02c2a","timestamp":"2026-04-11T11:01:14.230Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I found the FlyAI skill in the skills library. Let me check if there's a local hotel-competitor tool already deployed, and try to actually use it to generate a competitor analysis report.\n\nThe skill says:\n- Skill: 飞猪FlyAI旅行数据对接\n- Usage: flyai search-hotel --dest-name 天津滨海新区 --check-in-date 2026-03-31\n\nLet me check if flyai is installed locally."},{"type":"text","text":"找到了！技能库里已经有「飞猪FlyAI旅行数据对接」技能。检查本地是否已部署：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_94rwpf0lzk4k_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"which flyai 2>/dev/null || ls /home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/hotel-competitor/ 2>/dev/null || echo \"flyai not found locally\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775905263887,"responseId":"06295cf0667f8b700082a431c1de6329"}}
