{"type":"message","id":"29f2d450","parentId":"b6a5fb5e","timestamp":"2026-04-11T11:03:10.801Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_0ex884qlt2o3_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Usage: flyai [options] [command]\n\nFliggy travel CLI: hotels, flights, attractions & keyword search (飞猪旅行 CLI)\n\nOptions:\n  -h, --help                                   display help for command\n\nCommands:\n  search-poi [options]                         Search attractions (搜索景点)\n  search-hotel|search-hotels [options]         Search hotels (搜索酒店)\n  search-flight [options]                      Search flights, domestic & international (搜索机票)\n  search-train [options]                       Search trains(搜索火车票)\n  keyword-search|fliggy-fast-search [options]  Keyword search: classic keyword-based search for hotels, flights, etc. (关键词搜索)\n  ai-search [options]                          Semantic search for hotels, flights, etc. Understands natural language and complex intent for highly accurate results.（AI搜索）\n  search-marriott-package [options]            Search Marriott Group's hotel package products (搜索万豪集团旗下酒店套餐商品信息)\n  search-marriott-hotel [options]              Search hotels under Marriott Group (搜索万豪集团旗下酒店)\n  help [command]                               display help for command"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":54,"aggregated":"Usage: flyai [options] [command]\n\nFliggy travel CLI: hotels, flights, attractions & keyword search (飞猪旅行 CLI)\n\nOptions:\n  -h, --help                                   display help for command\n\nCommands:\n  search-poi [options]                         Search attractions (搜索景点)\n  search-hotel|search-hotels [options]         Search hotels (搜索酒店)\n  search-flight [options]                      Search flights, domestic & international (搜索机票)\n  search-train [options]                       Search trains(搜索火车票)\n  keyword-search|fliggy-fast-search [options]  Keyword search: classic keyword-b