{"type":"message","id":"3783d07d","parentId":"7472d5f1","timestamp":"2026-04-11T13:47:09.633Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_x6uu1pfmaqfp_1","toolName":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5295ff1364b4b1022c5f1dcc3e3\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"抱歉，造成干扰了🙏\\n已记录：**订单信息批量合并发送**，不逐条回复。\\n后续 @夏美娟/@值守前台 的工单，我会汇总同类订单一次发出，减少群内碎片。\\n也请各位同事发送订单时尽量**一次性说完**（如订单号+房型+日期+付款方式），方便我统一处理。谢谢🙏\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a935c107cd38dccc\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-11T17:57:50+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b5295fed9dca0c4dac0a3726eda4\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5295fed9dca0c4dac0a3726eda4\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"机器人在这里面一句一回的，信息都看不明白了[捂脸]\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_7ba638ebdf847f9bbccb712da38391a6\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"方明晔\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-11T17:57:21+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5295d36c68a4b24793e84783919\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"图片识别超时，请重发一下👋\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a935c107cd38dccc\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-11T17:52:26+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b5295dcfab0b8c1032aeefe9314a\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5295dd70cc88b3b114bf9fc2024\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"**浩海船务 · 新预订**\\n船名：SEAPASSION 海悦\\n房型：大床房 × 2间\\n入住：04月13日\\n退房：04月14日\\n付款方式：公司付费 | 签单密码：458\\n\\n---\\n\\n@值守前台 安排04月13日入住👌\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a935c107cd38dccc\",\n        \"sender_type